ruth about the affair, Chotrani questions the lack of evidence and calls it a political feud. The CBI is surprised when they get an unexpected call.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g5OPKc7nJ6b6Zb2vj4313qnCCu5.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVGhlLUNoYXJnZXNoZWV0LS1Jbm5vY2VudC1vci1HdWlsdHktLTIwMjAtLTEwODBwLw.1.8","title":"Judgement Day","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Both, the prosecution and defence, present their final statements. Will Shiraz get justice? Was it a cold-blooded murder or a political conspiracy?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hQofWGOGxfJYPDyiMAQy4wlTsLS.jpg"}]}}